      "body": "## Motivation\n\nFollow-up to #40468 (merged). Two issues from review:\n\n1. `ReasonerGrammarBackend.__init__` still resolved `think_end_ids` by encoding `think_end_token` as ordinary text. For Inkling the native `END_MESSAGE` id (200010) differs from its printed-spelling encoding, so every grammar that keeps the wrapper — strict thinking mode, and non-canonical constraints (json_schema / regex / modified structural_tag) with reasoning enabled — never observes think end and stays in the thinking phase. #40468 fixed the scheduler's `model_config.think_end_ids`, but `create_grammar_backend` only uses that value as a construction gate; the constructor re-encoded the marker on its own.\n\n2. The canonical-schema bypass matched schema content alone, so a byte-identical user-supplied `structural_tag` response format would bypass reasoning deferral regardless of the model's reasoning detector.\n\n## Modifications\n\n- Resolve `think_end_ids` via `reasoning_parser.detector.get_think_end_token_ids(tokenizer)` (the hook #40468 added) in `ReasonerGrammarBackend.__init__`.\n- Gate the canonical-schema bypass on the Inkling reasoning detector, and build the canonical schema once as a lazy module constant instead of reconstructing it per dispatch (the lazy import stays: `function_call.inkling_detector` imports xgrammar unconditionally, which XPU installs may not ship).\n- Tests: the backend resolves the native `END_MESSAGE` id and the wrapper transitions on it in both strict and non-strict mode; the canonical schema with a non-Inkling detector still defers until reasoning ends (folded into `test_other_grammars_still_defer_until_reasoning_ends`).\n\n## Tests\n\n`test/registered/unit/constrained/test_reasoner_grammar_backend.py`: 35 passed, 25 subtests passed (CPU devbox, torch + xgrammar, against current `main`).\n\n<!-- pr-states:start -->\n---\n### CI States\n\nLatest PR Test (Base): <!-- slot:pr-test:start -->:no_entry_sign: [Run #38274895711](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/38274895711)<!-- slot:pr-test:end -->\nLatest PR Test (Extra): <!-- slot:pr-test-extra:start -->:x: [Run #38274895200](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/38274895200)<!-- slot:pr-test-extra:end -->\nLatest PR Test (AMD ROCm 10): <!-- slot:pr-test-amd:start -->:x: [Run #38274895669](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/38274895669)<!-- slot:pr-test-amd:end -->\n<!-- pr-states:end -->",
